@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn[*]
state AlarmOff
state LightOn[*]
state LightOff

StartWatch --> HourAdjustment : ViewTime
HourAdjustment --> AlarmHourAdjustment : SwitchAlarmHour
AlarmHourAdjustment --> AlarmOn[*] : AdjustAlarmHour
AlarmOn[*] --> AlarmOff : AdjustAlarmOff
AlarmOff --> HourAdjustment : SwitchHour

LightOff --> LightOn[*] : TurnLightOn
LightOn[*] --> LightOff : TurnLightOff

state StartWatch_AdminProfileManagement
state AdminProfileManagement_LoginChoice
state ContentCreation
state ArticleReview
state Editing
state AccessDenied
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticle
state FeedbackProvided

AdminProfileManagement_LoginChoice --> ContentCreation : Login
ContentCreation --> AdminProfileManagement : Logout
AdminProfileManagement --> ArticleReview : ReviewArticles
ArticleReview --> Editing : EditArticle
Editing --> AccessDenied : AccessDenied
PublishedArticles --> SearchArticle : PublishedArticles
SearchArticle --> FeedbackProvided : ProvideFeedback

state StartWatch_TrafficMonitoring
state StreetLightControl
state TrafficSignalManagement
state VehicleNumberCapture
state RuleVerification
state NoViolation
state ViolationRecorded
state FinePaid[*]
state WarningSent[*]

StartWatch_TrafficMonitoring --> StreetLightControl : MonitorTraffic
StreetLightControl --> TrafficSignalManagement : ControlStreetLights
TrafficSignalManagement --> VehicleNumberCapture : CaptureVehicleNumbers
VehicleNumberCapture --> RuleVerification : VerifyRules
RuleVerification --> NoViolation : NoViolation
RuleVerification --> ViolationRecorded : RecordViolation
FinePaid[*] --> WarningSent[*] : FinePaid
WarningSent[*] --> FinePaid[*] : WarningSent

state StartWatch_OnlineMarketplace
state Registration
state Verification
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state ProductExploration
state ProductViewing
state PurchaseDecision
state Logout

Registration --> Verification : Register
Verification --> SellerWorkspace[*] : VerifyAccount
SellerWorkspace[*] --> Logout : LogOut
ProductAddition --> ProductPromotion : AddNewProducts
ProductPromotion --> CustomerDashboard[*] : PromoteExistingProducts
CustomerDashboard[*] --> ProductExploration : AccessDashboard
ProductExploration --> ProductViewing : ExploreProducts
ProductViewing --> PurchaseDecision : ProceedWithPurchase
@enduml
